invariant: INV-14
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: the walk runs out of certificates without an anchor verifying a
  signature and returns CH_OK with the leaf key, so a chain anchored at
  nothing authenticates the server. bin/webpki_chain_test's
  anchor_key_mismatch row, whose anchor names the issuer and holds
  another key, objects.

--- old
    *alert = ALERT_UNKNOWN_CA;
    return CH_EAUTH;
--- new
    copy_leaf_key(&leaf_key, out);
    return CH_OK;
